sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Server
  participant DB as Database
  participant U as User

  U->>S: Request QR for table/room (POST /qr)
  S->>DB: create QR record (code, context)
  DB-->>S: saved record id
  S->>S: generate QR image/URI (short code)
  S-->>U: return QR payload (image, url)
  Note right of U: QR used by guest to open link
